d the green card backlog. Specifically,\\n     2\\tshe would like to understand the current dates of filing for her category. She finds a\\n     3\\tscreenshot showing the current dates for green card filings based on different categories and birth countries.\\n     4\\tThe screenshot is under Documents/Human Resources Team/Immigration directory on owncloud. Please read the image and tell\\n     5\\ther the current date of filing for her category based on the information provided in the image. If you need any information, please ask her. You can find\\n     6\\ther on RocketChat.\\n     7\\t\\n     8\\tRocketChat link: http://the-agent-company.com:3000\\n     9\\towncloud link: http://the-agent-company.com:8092/\\n\", path='/instruction/task.md', observation=<ObservationType.READ: 'read'>, impl_source='oh_aci'), MCPAction(name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud'}, thought=\"Now I understand the task. I need to:\\n1. Access the owncloud to find the screenshot in the Documents/Human Resources Team/Immigration directory\\n2. Read the image to find the current date of filing for Priya Sharma's category\\n3. Communicate with her on RocketChat if I need more information\\n\\nLet me first check if there are existing SOPs for accessing owncloud and RocketChat:\", action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Known operations for \\'ownCloud\\': Authentication, FileNavigation, FileUploadDownload, CreateCareerLadderDocument, AttendanceAnalysis, FindAndDownloadSeedAreaFile, CompleteIRSForm6765, PaymentMatchingAnalysis, CreateJobDescriptionAndShareLink, CreateEmployeeManual\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_platform_guide_list', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud'}), MCPAction(name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'ownCloud', 'operation': 'Authentication'}, thought='', a